# Turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the
# branch protection rules. Then a pull request that changes the rules can't be merged
# without a human's approval: an agent can't get a red gate green by loosening them.
# @emanuilo approves changes to the rules (the people or team who own the shape).
# Paths are from the repository root; adjust them if you moved a file.

# [tool.shape], [tool.importlinter] and [tool.vulture] live here (or in your --config file)
/pyproject.toml                 @emanuilo
# the baseline: known violations (or the path you set in [tool.shape] baseline)
/.code-shape-baseline.json      @emanuilo
# dead-code whitelist ([tool.shape] dead_code_whitelist)
/vulture_whitelist.py           @emanuilo
# import-linter contracts, if they live in their own file
/.importlinter                  @emanuilo
# the CI gate itself
/.github/workflows/code-shape.yml   @emanuilo
